  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">OHCHR Colombia 2017-2021 - Evaluation</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">OHCHR Colombia 2017-2021</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">OHCHRs work plan revolves around six strategic pillars that define the agency&apos;s operations and main objectives in Colombia. Namely:

- Strengthening rule of law and accountability for human rights violations

- Enhancing and Protecting Civic Space and Peoples Participation

- Pillar: Enhancing equality and countering discrimination

- Integrating human rights in sustainable development

- Early warning, prevention and protection of human rights in situations of conflict and insecurity

- Increasing implementation of the international human rights mechanisms` outcome</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sveriges regering har bekr&#xe4;ftat sitt st&#xf6;d f&#xf6;r verksamheten vid FN:s h&#xf6;gkommissarie f&#xf6;r m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter i Colombia (2017-2021) med ett totalt bidrag p&#xe5; 62 600 000 SEK. Det &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;let f&#xf6;r insatsen &#xe4;r att l&#xe5;na ut allm&#xe4;nt st&#xf6;d till verksamheten vid OHCHR kontor i Colombia.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Government of Sweden has confirmed its intention to support the operations of the UN Office of the High Commissioner for Human Rights in Colombia (2017-2021) with a total contribution of SEK 62 600 000. The overall aim of contribution will be to lend general support to the operations of OHCHR&#x2019;s Office in Colombia.</narrative>
  </description>
